@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
!include ../includes/sequence-conventions.puml
title Publish Definition Package
actor User
participant "Publish adapter" as Adapter
participant "PublishDefinitionPackageUC" as UC
participant "Local acquisition driver" as Local
participant "attestify-oci publication driver" as OCI
User -> Adapter: nape package publish
Adapter -> UC: local package handle
UC -> Local: reopen and verify
Local --> UC: verified package
UC -> OCI: publish exact bytes
OCI --> UC: clean re-pull equality
UC --> Adapter: governed outcome
@enduml
